+- **Request 17**: Add VAT report
+  - Added vatSummary(invoices) to src/reports.js
+  - Returns array with one entry per VAT rate: [{ rate, base, vat }]
+  - Filter criteria:
+    - status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid' (excludes draft)
+  - Calculations per line:
+    - base = lineTotal - lineDiscount (line amount after discount)
+    - vat = base * (vatRate / 100), rounded per line
+  - Aggregates across all lines in all filtered invoices
+  - Sorting: by rate descending (21, 9, 0)
+  - All amounts clamped to >= 0
+  - Added 14 comprehensive tests for VAT summary functionality
+  - All 235 tests passing (221 existing + 14 new)
+
 ## Constraints
 - Money is always integer cents (use roundCents())
 - Never throw; return fail(CODE) with codes in ERRORS
